WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
Hahahaha I'm a dignified S-level weirdo

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:06,160
What I'm best at is using my fists to reason with people.

3
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:12,700
The pair inside is you. I'm interested in your room.

4
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,740
The stone statue just slides out and doesn't let me do anything.

5
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:16,660
Take a fancy to my room

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:23,060
A weirdo who has just entered the third S level dares to steal my room.

7
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:26,620
Stop, stop, stop, this big brother just had a misunderstanding.

8
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:30,180
I'm a new leaf owner and I just want to get to know my new neighbors.

9
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,300
New leaf master
